sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Publisher
    participant R as Secured MCP Registry
    participant S as Safety Review
    participant C as Approved Catalogue
    participant N as Notifications

    P->>R: 1. Sign in and create a service entry
    P->>R: 2. Provide ownership, purpose and permission details
    P->>R: 3. Submit the MCP service and version
    R->>S: 4. Request identity, safety and quality checks
    S-->>R: 5. Return approval or required changes

    alt Changes are required
        R-->>P: 6A. Explain what must be corrected
        P->>R: 7A. Update and resubmit the service
        R->>S: 8A. Repeat the review
    else Service is approved
        R->>C: 6B. Publish the approved service
        C-->>P: 7B. Confirm that the service is discoverable
        N-->>P: 8B. Send publication confirmation
    end

    P->>R: 9. Submit updates and new versions
    R->>S: 10. Recheck trust and safety
    R->>C: 11. Update, suspend or retire the listing
    N-->>P: 12. Notify the publisher of status changes
